{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_195_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，意如至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"大夫執則致，致則名。意如惡，然而致，見君臣之禮也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"二、三月，曹伯滕卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"四、秋，葬曹武公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"五、八月，莒子去疾卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"六、冬，莒殺其公子意恢。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_195_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_195","textTraditional":"言公子而不言大夫，莒無大夫也。莒無大夫而曰公子意恢，意恢賢也。曹、莒皆無大夫，其所以無大夫者，其義異也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}